  "body": "Stacked on #2027 (merge #2027 first)\n\n## What changed\n- Added 18 geometry tokens to `theme::Tokens` and built-in `DARK`/`LIGHT` tables in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme.rs` and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme/tables.rs`, preserving built-in pixel defaults.\n- Extracted theme clamp constants into `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme/clamp.rs` (adding `EYE_RESERVE`, `HEADER_BOOST`, `STROKE`) and theme key constants into `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme_files/names.rs` to keep module sizes within ~400 lines.\n- Wired the 18 tokens into `theme_files::GEOM_NAMES` and `overlay::apply_overlay`, clamping `font_label_min` to `<= font_label`.\n- Updated `op_tabs::tab_bar`, `painted::cell`/`fit_label`/`tree`, `tree_badges::row_glyph`, `browser_pane::browser`/`drag_ops`, `op_page::operation_page`, and `geo_page` (`pick_block`/`body`/`chips`) to read the clamped tokens for spacing, typography, icons, eye reserve, drag insertion stroke, and geometry row hover highlight.\n- Recorded the design choices in `docs/decisions/2066-theme-op-tabs-tree.md`.\n\n## Cause\nOperation tabs, browser tree layout and glyphs, ribbon label min-size shrinking, and geometry row hover highlights read hardcoded constants or widget visuals instead of `theme::Tokens`.\n\n## Tests\n- Pins added in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/theme_op_tabs_tree.rs` (`geo_row_highlight_reads_widget_radius_and_stroke`, `op_tabs_respect_theme_tokens_and_clamps`, `ribbon_min_label_floor_comes_from_theme`, `browser_tree_and_pane_follow_theme_tokens`) and `crates/ui/tests/theme_files.rs` (`op_tab_and_tree_tokens_fit_cap_and_clamp`).\n- Before the fix on `base-2027`, all 4 tests in `theme_op_tabs_tree` failed (`geo_row_highlight` expected `CornerRadius { nw: 9 }`, got `2`; the other 3 failed on unknown token `font_label_min`).\n- Mutation checks verified failures on revert and passes on restore for `op_tabs.rs` (`op_tab_h` 22 vs 34), `browser_pane.rs` (`tree_pad_x` 6 vs 10), `geo_page.rs` + `op_page.rs` (`CornerRadius` 2 vs 9), `painted.rs` (`font_label_min` 10 vs 14 and depth 0 x 24 vs 33), and `tree_badges.rs` (`tree_glyph_px` 16 vs 22).\n- After the final edit, `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib egui_app::tests::theme_op_tabs_tree` passed (4/4), `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed with 0 warnings, and `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed in 19s (`ui lib`, `boundary`, `boundary_picks`, `sinker_setup`, `theme_files`, `waterjet_tool`; 0 failed).\n\n## Goldens moved\nNone (`git diff --stat base-2027 -- \"*.nc\" \"*.cl\"` returned empty).\n\n## Not exercised\n- `assets/themes/theme.json.example` does not exist on `upstream/main` or `#2027` yet (#2038), so no example file was updated here.\n- `painted::caption` and its `MIN_LABEL_PX` path remain untouched.\n\n## Overlaps\n- Stacked on `#2027` (merge `#2027` first).\n- `#1701` touches `crates/ui/src/egui_app/geo_page.rs::chips` lines 141-179; this PR modifies `chips` signature and line 186 (different lines, same function; whichever merges second refreshes).\n- `#2086` touches `crates/ui/src/egui_app/painted.rs::caption`; this PR touches `cell`, `fit_label`, and `tree` only (different functions, same file; whichever merges second refreshes).\n\nChangelog: Operation tab strip, browser tree spacing/glyph/eye sizing, ribbon min-label floor and geometry highlight radius read theme tokens.\nFixes #2066\n\n\n## Before and after\n\nBoth images show the browser tree, operation tabs, and the geometry highlight with the same custom theme settings. The capture uses the real egui widgets and GPU rendering. The before image uses the parent drawing code at `739b7ce5`. The after image uses the PR drawing code at `0144f249`. Both use the PR theme parser and token tables so the same fixture applies. Only the drawing code changes between captures. The temporary capture harness is not part of this PR.\n\nBefore: compact tabs and tree glyphs, with a thin square geometry outline.\n\n![Before: parent drawing with custom theme settings](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/29c4417b/2095/before.png)\n\nAfter: theme-sized tabs and tree glyphs, with a thick rounded geometry outline.\n\n![After: PR drawing with custom theme settings](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mkinney/Camcraft/29c4417b/2095/after.png)\n\nThe images are stored only on the fork's images-only `pr-screenshots` branch.\n",
